            ["do.restrict-home"] = new BoardActionDef("do.restrict-home", "Limit the clearings a seat may pick as its home during setup: the Paintress's first roost to the Monolith, Clea's home to the Flying Manor, the Curator's home to a free corner other than Lumière and the Monolith. On Autumn also Gustave's keep, to Lumière (autumn.01); on other maps his keep is free and the corner it goes in becomes Lumière.", "void RestrictHomeChoice(SeatId seat, IReadOnlyList<ClearingId> allowed)", true, "Highlight the required clearing for a human and steer a bot there with do.submit-action. Roles never move, so a human who picks another corner is warned that the character's rules still point at the role clearing (Clea still needs her atelier in the Flying Manor)."),
